## Interface: 16001, 16002
## Title: Destroy Advisor
## Notes: Lists the items in your bags that are safe to destroy or sell, and says why: grey junk, quest leftovers whose quests you've done or can't take, bound gear your class can never use, things you already know. Nothing a quest still needs is ever suggested.
## Version: 1.0.1
## OptionalDeps: Questie, QuestieDB, Baganator
## SavedVariables: DestroyAdvisorDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bag_07_Red
## AddonCompartmentFunc: DestroyAdvisor_Toggle

